                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (X,\mathcal{A},p)\to(Y,\mathcal{B},q)
            is a kernel between the underlying measurable spaces
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi k
